      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not entirely familiar with the role mime types serve in relation to Intents, but I wonder if it\u0027s really necessary for Chooser to be determining this logic -- it seems unusual that we\u0027d have to be responsible for setting the explicit type. What happens if we just use `setData()`? Or, would it at least be possible to use one of the Intent helper methods like `Intent.resolveType()` (or better yet, if possible `Intent.resolveTypeIfNeeded()`)?",
