      "writtenOn": "2022-04-01T03:10:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think ContentResolver#getType() is better.\nEdit button is shown only when preview type is CONTENT_PREVIEW_IMAGE.\nIt is decided at ChooserActivity#findPreferredContentPreview().\nWhen action is ACTION_SEND, preview type can be CONTENT_PREVIEW_IMAGE only when ContentResolver#getType() start with \"image/\".\nSo we can always get same mimeType here.",
      "parentUuid": "daf978db_fb52667a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1184,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 1185,
        "endChar": 64
