      "writtenOn": "2022-03-31T14:24:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sharesheet is only expected to be called with ACTION_SEND and ACTION_SEND_MULTIPLE. We could log an error and bail for other actions or assume these are the only two (there are examples of each elsewhere in ChooserActivity)",
