      "message": "Currently, edit button is shown only when ACTION_SEND and ACTION_SEND_MULTIPLE.\nEdit button is created at ChooserActivity#displayImageContentPreview().\nIt is called only when preview type is CONTENT_PREVIEW_IMAGE.\nPreview type is decided at ChooserActivity#findPreferredContentPreview().\nOnly ACTION_SEND and ACTION_SEND_MULTIPLE can become CONTENT_PREVIEW_IMAGE.\n\nCan we use current code?\nIs it better to change to \"} else {\" for future modification just in case?",
